# BOBCat lazy-definition semantic regression fixture

```catala
declaration above_ten content boolean
  depends on x content integer
  equals x > 10

declaration scope HelperGoal:
  input x content integer
  output result content integer

scope HelperGoal:
  definition result equals
    if above_ten of x then
      if x <= 10 then 1 else 2
    else 3
```
